sequenceDiagram
    actor Evaluator
    participant API as GET Adapter
    participant PreR as Pre-router
    participant Planner as HyperCLOVA X
    participant Ground as Grounder (Stage-2)
    participant Validator as Plan Validator
    participant Exec as Executor (single or cross-scope)
    participant DB as DuckDB
    participant Evidence as Evidence Builder
    participant Answer as Renderer and Claim Validator
    Evaluator->>API: question_id + question
    API->>API: byte budget, redaction, contract check
    API->>PreR: canonical question
    alt exact code/ISIN/ticker match
        PreR-->>API: deterministic lookup plan (HCX skipped)
    else needs interpretation
        PreR->>Planner: canonical question + concept-only plan schema
        Planner-->>Ground: typed concept plan (no physical field names)
        Ground-->>API: physical QueryPlan (fail-closed on unresolvable concept)
    end
    API->>Validator: schema + registry policy
    alt invalid plan
        Validator-->>Planner: one bounded repair request
        Planner-->>Validator: repaired QueryPlan
    end
    Validator->>Exec: allow-listed compiled plan
    alt cross-scope plan
        Exec->>Exec: decompose into per-scope subplans
    end
    Exec->>DB: parameterized deterministic query per scope
    DB-->>Evidence: rows + universe + execution metadata
    alt cross-scope plan
        Evidence-->>Evidence: fuse per comparability mode + mandatory disclosure
    end
    Evidence-->>Answer: evidence IDs + limitations
    Answer->>Answer: every factual claim must cite evidence
    Answer-->>API: DomainAnswer
    API-->>Evaluator: provisional 5-string JSON + no-store
